---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout pageKey="appTerms" currentPage="" lang="en">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50 font-sans p-6 md:p-12 lg:p-24 selection:bg-emerald-500/30">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="space-y-6 pb-12 border-b border-zinc-800/50">
        <a href="/en/" class="inline-flex items-center text-zinc-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors text-sm font-medium group">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mr-2 group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
          Back to klikkr.ch
        </a>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Terms of Use</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-zinc-400 font-medium">Klikkr App (Android, iOS, Wear OS and Apple Watch)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/50">
          <span>Effective Date: November 9, 2026</span>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">•</span>
          <a href="mailto:support@klikkr.ch" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">support@klikkr.ch</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="space-y-12">

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">1. Provider and Scope</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            These terms apply to the Klikkr app for Android and iOS and to its companion apps for
            Wear OS and Apple Watch (together the "App"). By using the App you agree to them.
            Purchases of Klikkr wristbands on klikkr.ch are governed by the shop's terms and
            conditions.
          </p>
          <div class="p-6 bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800/50 rounded-2xl leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-emerald-400">Wild Tec</strong> (Sole Proprietorship)<br />
            Owner: Andri Wild<br />
            Im Baumgarten 4<br />
            6252 Dagmersellen, Switzerland<br />
            UID: CHE-386.932.040<br /><br />
            <strong>Email:</strong>{' '}
            <a href="mailto:support@klikkr.ch" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">support@klikkr.ch</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">2. What the App Does</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            The App keeps score for tennis, padel, squash, badminton, table tennis and pickleball.
            You count points with Klikkr wristbands, with a smartwatch or directly on your phone.
            The App knows the rules of each sport and offers tournaments and statistics.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">3. Free and Paid Features</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            The App is free, and so is scoring with Klikkr wristbands or on your phone.
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-zinc-50">Smartwatch feature:</strong> With an Apple Watch or a
            Wear OS watch you can score three matches for free. After that, a one-time in-app
            purchase unlocks the watch permanently. It is not a subscription and there are no
            recurring charges.
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            The store shows the price before you buy (CHF 10 in Switzerland). The purchase belongs
            to the Apple ID or Google account you bought it with, so it covers all your watches on
            that platform. It cannot be transferred between Apple and Google. After reinstalling or
            on a new phone, get it back in the App with "Restore purchase".
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Payment, receipts and refunds are handled by Apple or Google under their terms. For
            purchases through the App Store, Apple's
            <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors" rel="noopener">Standard License Agreement</a>
            also applies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">4. Requirements and Availability</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Wristbands and phone connect via Bluetooth. The smartwatch feature requires an Apple
            Watch with watchOS 10 or later or a watch with Wear OS 3 or later. Buying and restoring
            need a connection to the store; after that, the watch also works offline.
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Wireless connections can be disrupted. We work to keep the App reliable but cannot
            guarantee it. You can take back a wrongly counted point at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">5. Use During Sport</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            The App is a scoring aid, not an official umpiring system and not a medical device. The
            score the players agree on is what counts. The workout session the Apple Watch starts
            during a match only keeps the watch counting; the App does not measure or evaluate
            health data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">6. Rights to the App</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            The App and its content belong to Wild Tec. You may use the App for your own purposes.
            You may modify, reverse engineer or resell it only to the extent mandatory law allows.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">7. Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for damage arising from use of the
            App, in particular for wrongly counted points, lost scores or dropped connections.
            Liability for intent and gross negligence remains reserved.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">8. Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            How the App handles data is described in the
            <a href="/en/app-privacy/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">App privacy policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4 pb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-50">9. Changes and Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            We may update these terms; the version published here applies. Swiss law applies. The
            place of jurisdiction is Dagmersellen, Switzerland, unless the law mandatorily provides
            otherwise. Mandatory consumer protection rules of your country of residence remain
            reserved. If the language versions differ, the German version prevails.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
